---
import '../styles/global.css';
import Head from '../layouts/Head.astro'
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import PortfolioLayout from '../layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
	<Head title="Portfolio"/>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<div class="page">
            <Navigation />
			<div class="content" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
				<h1>Portfolio</h1>
                <p>Hello, I'm Jack, a games programmer from the North-East of England.</p>
			</div>
            <PortfolioLayout project="Inventory System" date=">.Present" image="InventorySystem.png" alt="">
                <p class="desc"></p>
                <div class="skills">
					UE 5.7.4<br>
					C++<br>
					Plugin Dev<br>
                </div>
                <div slot="expand">
                    WOW THIS IS A DIV WHICH I NEED TO MAKE EXPAND SOMEHOW. IM SURE THAT WILL BE FUN TO FIGURE OUT WOOoooOoOoOoOoOoOoOoOoOo
                </div>
            </PortfolioLayout>
            <PortfolioLayout project="JustSpirit.dev" date="02/10/'26" image="JSDev.png" alt="">
                <p class="desc">The very website you are reading this on. Planned to include all sorts such as: a gallery; fiction writing; blog posts; and a forum...?</p>
                <div class="skills">
					Astro<br>
					HTML<br>
					CSS<br>
                </div>
                <div slot="expand">
                    JustSpirit.dev is my custom website built to house whatever I wish. The website has been made using Astro, hosted on GitHub, protected by Cloudflare with the domain provided via Hostinger. It's constantly expanding as I work on adding new things.
